-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:54:      when_exists: "Admission refuses a pre-existing path, registered worktree or branch with that name and never reuses it."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:55:      owner_after_creation: "The Build controller that created it, bound by its owner record (build id, control root, branch, base commit A)."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:56:      owner_during_operation: "The controller owns topology; the Developer may edit Candidate files; verification, Jev and Review read them."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:57:      permitted_mutation: "Developer edits inside the Candidate; the controller writes the Approved copy, Complete package and commit. Automatic removal only after successful publication (git worktree remove without --force). Otherwise only mix kogen.candidates.remove on the Shaper's request."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:58:      validation: "Every removal checks the path is under <workspaces-root>/<project-id>/, matches its owner record and is registered in this control repository. Running Candidates, and accepted-unpublished ones without --discard-accepted, are refused."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:59:      git_state: "Outside the control tree; listed by the control repository's git worktree list until removed; control status unaffected."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:60:      upgrade_behavior: "Worktrees without a Kogen owner record, including .kogen/runtime/build-worktrees/** from earlier experiments, are foreign and never touched; no migration."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:62:      when_exists: "Admission refuses an existing branch with that name."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:63:      owner_after_creation: "The Build controller, then the Shaper through the Candidate commands."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:64:      owner_during_operation: "The controller makes the one publication commit; the Developer commits nothing."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:65:      permitted_mutation: "git branch -d after successful publication; git branch -D only through remove under the guards above."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:66:      validation: "An accepted commit not reachable from the admitted branch is deleted only with --discard-accepted."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:67:      git_state: "Local branch; never pushed."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:68:      upgrade_behavior: "Branches from earlier experiments (kogen/build/<intent-id>/<id>) are foreign and untouched."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:70:      when_exists: "An existing owner record for the new build id refuses admission; a record naming a different control root under this project id stops admission."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:71:      owner_after_creation: "The Build controller writes it and updates the status at every exit; the Candidate commands read and delete it."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:72:      owner_during_operation: "Outside the Candidate; roles have no reason to touch it; not hostile containment."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:73:      permitted_mutation: "Status transitions running -> stopped/accepted-unpublished, or deletion on publication or removal. A running status counts only while the project's build lock is held by a live process."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:74:      validation: "Malformed or mismatched records are reported and skipped, never used to delete a path."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:75:      git_state: "Not in any repository."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:76:      upgrade_behavior: "Versioned schema field; no earlier records exist."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:78:      when_exists: "Admission refuses a pre-existing harness home for the new build id."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:79:      owner_after_creation: "The Build controller; Claude Code and Codex write their own session state inside it."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:80:      owner_during_operation: "Every role launch of this Build and nothing else; it never holds a credential."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:81:      permitted_mutation: "Harness-native writes during the Build. Kept after publication as session evidence; removed only with a retained Candidate by mix kogen.candidates.remove."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:82:      validation: "Removal uses the same owner-record and path checks as the worktree; a home without an owner record is never deleted by Kogen."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:83:      git_state: "Not in any repository."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:84:      upgrade_behavior: "No earlier homes exist; accumulation after publication is parked with Candidate prune (SHAPE_CANDIDATE_PRUNE.md)."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:86:      when_exists: "Referenced by path only: CLAUDE_SECURESTORAGE_CONFIG_DIR for Claude Code, CODEX_HOME for Codex."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:87:      owner_after_creation: "The Shaper through mix kogen.{claude,codex}.login; the harness runtimes own their contents."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:88:      owner_during_operation: "Build roles reach them only through the runtime's own credential lookup and refresh lock; the write boundary lets a role write only the Claude refresh lock and the Codex scope minus its refused and Kogen-owned entries (role-write-boundary, codex-roles-inside-boundary)."
-.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:89:      permitted_mutation: "Kogen never creates, copies, links, moves or renames anything in a scope for this Intent; harness-native writes (token refresh, Codex rollouts) continue as today."
