+        end
+    end
+  end
+
+  @doc """
+  Whether the hook toolchain (the `python` version `mise.toml` pins, which
+  `.codex/hooks/*.py` runs under) meets its required version. Returns `:ok`
+  or `{:error, reason}`. See `claude_scope_ready?/1` for the controlled
+  switch.
